# The eval harness writes the run's stream transcript (transcript.jsonl) and the
# final reply (handoff.txt) inside this working copy, and the commit gate's
# --verify-tree rightly refuses to commit around an undeclared file. Ignored files
# do not appear in `git status --porcelain`, so both stay out of the lane's tree
# check - the same reason bgpdd-bugfix-lane's fixture ignores handoff.txt.
handoff.txt
transcript.jsonl
node_modules/
